I’ll (1) decode and validate the SELFIES, (2) identify the molecule and its structure, (3) obtain or calculate the LUMO energy in Hartree, and (4) return only the requested JSON number.

Tool call: go_search_agent
Tool call input: {'knowledge_bases': ['chemistry'], 'search_rounds_budget': 2, 'search_target': 'Determine the molecular structure represented by the SELFIES string [C][C][C][O][C][Branch1][C][C][Branch1][=Branch1][C][Ring1][=Branch1][Ring1][Branch1][C][Ring1][#Branch1][O], and find an authoritative or database-recorded LUMO energy for that exact molecule. Report the structure, identifiers, and LUMO energy with units, preferably Hartree.'}
